# Browser-proof screenshots and probe logs stay in the repository but are not part of the release
# archive (`git archive`) that CI and the host receiver build from: the receiver caps it at 50 MiB
# and the evidence alone had grown to 19 MB (pre-deploy review host-03, 2026-10-23).
docs/agent-work/evidence/** export-ignore
# The release manifest writer learns from these two placeholders that its build context is a `git archive`
# of a commit (which commit, and when): the image's source offer lists only that archive's files.
apps/docs/synwevo_docs/source_manifest.py export-subst
